@VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7199
# Sign in with an allowlisted account first. Supply its Cookie header (including
# the antiforgery cookie) and the token returned by /auth/antiforgery below.
@sessionCookies = <authenticated-session-and-antiforgery-cookies>
@csrfToken = <antiforgery-token>

### Obtain an antiforgery token using the authenticated session
GET {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/auth/antiforgery
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
Accept: application/json

### Default table page: pageIndex=0, pageSize=10; no optional filters
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Filtered table page: inclusive timestamps, encoded search and offset, all filters
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?pageIndex=0&pageSize=10&startDate=2026-09-01T00%3A00%3A00%2B08%3A00&endDate=2026-09-23T23%3A59%3A59.999%2B08%3A00&searchTerm=Contoso%20%26%20Partners&validationStatus=Passed&verification=Validated&fullyPassed=true
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Next matching page; explicit false is retained, not omitted
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?pageIndex=1&pageSize=10&fullyPassed=false
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid pagination: HTTP 400 ValidationProblemDetails, no TGS request
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?pageIndex=-1&pageSize=0
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Page size above maximum: HTTP 400
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?pageSize=101
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Invalid filters: HTTP 400 (omit filters rather than sending All)
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?validationStatus=Unknown&fullyPassed=invalid
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Invalid verification: HTTP 400
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?verification=All
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Reversed inclusive date bounds: HTTP 400
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAiVirtualAssistantRegistrations?startDate=2026-09-23T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

### Independent global notifications: legacy all-data load, never used by table Query
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetNotificationRegistrations
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Independent overview: legacy all-data aggregation with its own date bounds
POST {{VAAdminPortalAPI_HostAddress}}/Admin/GetAllOverview?startDate=2026-09-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-09-23T23:59:59.999Z
Cookie: {{sessionCookies}}
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Accept: application/json
